{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>$268起!任食炭燒牛小排/安格斯牛</p><p>The Grill Room旺角開分店！</p><p>The Grill Room @thegrillroomhk 憑高質牛扒放題套餐，是鋸扒愛好者的熱門之選。最近餐廳於旺角雅蘭中心開分店，最平$268起任食多款和牛肉，包括安格斯牛肉、和牛牛小排、和牛三角肉、牛肩肉眼等，限時 90 分鐘，各位食肉獸去旺角又多個好選擇啦！</p><p>90分鐘任食多款和牛扒！</p><p>套餐包任食多款牛扒，各有不同口感及風味，其中和牛牛小排油花分布細緻，肉質柔嫩而富有彈性，切開後呈現誘人的粉嫩色澤；安格斯牛肉外層炙烤後帶有微微焦香，入口柔嫩而帶少許紮實感；牛肩肉眼肉味濃郁，油花分布均勻，嫩滑多汁。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1787286008282120_19778037676a87d1f927769.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17872860114252513_12400564316a87d1fc2592d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178728601500556766_12591241106a87d1ffbb903.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178728601765593314_11486921916a87d20269ecf.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178728602044136794_403402616a87d2052dafa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178728602329785063_16581175806a87d2081d9d4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178728602559235097_4358446666a87d20a5f925.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T04:44:33.376164+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":368,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}